<title>USA: ABR Information names O'Drobinak CFO.</title>
<headline>ABR Information names O'Drobinak CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PALM HARBOR, Florida 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABR Information Services Inc said Thursday it had named James O'Drobinak as its chief financial officer.  </p>
<p>The company said O'Drobinak had worked as chief financial officer of North American operations at Danka Industries Inc before accepting the position.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the company said he was replacing someone who had been working as acting chief financial officer without elaborating.</p>
</text>
